                    "speaker": "npc",
                    "emotion": "happy",
                    "textKey": "dialogue.npc.guard.heed.return.1",
                    "text": "Well, color me impressed. Not many in our town could survive out there..."
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "npc",
                    "emotion": "happy",
                    "textKey": "dialogue.npc.guard.heed.return.2",
                    "text": "Tell you what, If you gear up right, and show me that you're ready, I'll help you learn how to fight these evil beasts."
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "player",
                    "emotion": "happy",
                    "textKey": "dialogue.npc.guard.heed.return.choice.prompt",
                    "text": "How should I respond?",
